      "writtenOn": "2024-07-11T13:10:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like we should be able to move this logic outside of the if-elseif chain in order to avoid repeating it.\n\nIn the case of compute, we\u0027re reporting an error, so the output is irrelevant.\n\nFor fragment and vertex, we\u0027re doing the same logic just with a slightly different binding specifier.\n\nFor runtime programs, they don\u0027t output direct to Metal anyway (and wouldn\u0027t have an output struct regardless).",
