      "message": "Oh that\u0027s embarrassing, I added the flat and no-perspective code to the fragment *output*.  The fragment annotations need to be handled in `writeInputStruct`.\n\nI added a `writeInterpolatedAttributes()` function that handles the user location and these new attributes that is called for vertex outputs and fragment inputs.",
